{"kind": "mod", "id": 592, "name": "Amands's Graphics", "slug": "amandss-graphics", "teaser": "Lighting and postprocessing overhaul", "owner_name": "Amands2Mello", "downloads": 838022, "favourites": 174, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.amanda.graphics", "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/813.png", "category": "Retextures", "category_id": 10, "updated_at": "2026-08-02T06:02:13.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-09-01T14:49:17.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-09-01T14:49:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.8.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Amands’s Graphics</strong></p>\n<p>This mod changes <strong>EFT</strong>’s default lighting and postprocessing</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ytmt4ug.png\" alt=\"ytmt4ug.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eNmTpEQ.png\" alt=\"eNmTpEQ.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XiTnN90.png\" alt=\"XiTnN90.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NRpNUaN.png\" alt=\"NRpNUaN.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VufOUz7.png\" alt=\"VufOUz7.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NYjqQ9U.png\" alt=\"NYjqQ9U.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TUSZpDg.png\" alt=\"TUSZpDg.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8pnt7pn.png\" alt=\"8pnt7pn.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hTQl5gV.png\" alt=\"hTQl5gV.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DwpFBLO.png\" alt=\"DwpFBLO.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rtvmEP1.png\" alt=\"rtvmEP1.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GooNw2o.png\" alt=\"GooNw2o.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UAIlnLR.png\" alt=\"UAIlnLR.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8HcEWmN.png\" alt=\"8HcEWmN.png\" /></p>\n<p>Graphics toggle default key is <strong>Insert.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Default Brightness, lighting, fog and tone map settings</strong> can be changed by pressing <strong>F12</strong></p>\n<p>(click somewhere else to leave)<strong>.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Advanced settings allows for better customization</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KyryRH.gif\" alt=\"0KyryRH.gif\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Tone mapping</strong> was improved and now has options <strong>ACES</strong> and <strong>Filmic</strong>. Brightness can be changed.</p>\n<p><strong>ColorCorrectionCurves</strong>, <strong>LUT</strong>, <strong>CC_Vintage</strong> and <strong>CustomGlobalFog</strong> were removed to improve black levels.</p>\n<p><strong>Experimental maps Sun color</strong> was improved.</p>\n<p><strong>Presets</strong> you can save and load presets, they are saved at <strong>BepInEx/plugins/AmandsGraphics/.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>EFT</strong>’s <strong>PostFX</strong> still works, although I recommend disabling any <strong>Color grading.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>FPS</strong> shouldn’t change while <strong>GPU</strong> limited and not using <strong>Cinematic Features</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Experimental/Cinematic Features</strong> NVG overhaul,Flashlight overhaul**,** MysticalGlow**,** HBAO tweaks, Motion blur, Depth of field when using scopes, Optics Depth of field and Z-Blur overhaul.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V7rqSgb.png\" alt=\"V7rqSgb.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JlPpC9b.png\" alt=\"JlPpC9b.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h1WAIh7.png\" alt=\"h1WAIh7.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CST1OHf.png\" alt=\"CST1OHf.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6KNNuta.png\" alt=\"6KNNuta.png\" /></p>\n<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LccjGd6.png\" alt=\"LccjGd6.png\" /></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Planned Features</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Experimental maps Better</strong> <strong>Sun colors</strong> and <strong>Skylight colors</strong>.</p>\n<p>New Cinematic Features.</p>\n<p>Flashlights rework improvements.</p>\n<p><strong>Known Issues</strong></p>\n<p>Flashlight sometimes needs toggle to activate.</p>\n<p><strong>AmandsGraphics</strong>’s <strong>Compatible mods</strong></p>\n<p><strong>CWX</strong>’s <strong>DESHARPENER</strong></p>\n<p><strong>SamSWAT</strong>’s <strong>Time &amp; Weather Changer</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Fontaine’s FOV Fix</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Thanks to CWX, SamSWAT</strong> for their mods helping me on modding in general.</p>\n<p><strong>r1ft</strong>’s <strong>ByeByeBlackFilter</strong> <strong>mod</strong> also removes <strong>ColorCorrectionCurves.</strong></p>\n<p>thanks pin for beta testing</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4wQWdlI.png\" alt=\"4wQWdlI.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WRWmpIP.png\" alt=\"WRWmpIP.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pGnCvnA.png\" alt=\"pGnCvnA.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IjUbv2i.png\" alt=\"IjUbv2i.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0IfjcjI.png\" alt=\"0IfjcjI.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RXjUEc4.png\" alt=\"RXjUEc4.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Fo7o7qb.png\" alt=\"Fo7o7qb.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6kj2jgc.png\" alt=\"6kj2jgc.png\" /></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.5.3", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.6", "content_length": null, "downloads": 128938, "published_at": "2023-10-09T01:45:39.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/592/amandss-graphics/1.5.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 79127, "published_at": "2024-04-02T07:18:57.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/592/amandss-graphics/1.6.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 64130, "published_at": "2024-05-10T18:22:08.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/592/amandss-graphics/1.6.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.3", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 135967, "published_at": "2024-07-06T20:30:36.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/592/amandss-graphics/1.6.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.5", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 226933, "published_at": "2024-11-29T05:26:16.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/592/amands